  "description": "Spec hover, e2e: issue-1330-hover's hovered row in a dark Omarchy theme (tests/e2e/fixtures/omarchy-theme): the revealed Settings button and the status bar's 'hover \u00b7 # general' segment in the theme's colours (hover-omarchy); Esc releases it.",
  "timeoutSeconds": 60,
  "prefs": {
